            "review_title": "Review at Bep Quan",
            "review_text": "Dominicus d\nNunspeet, The Netherlands15 contributions\n0\nDisappointing experience not recommended\nMay 2025 • Family\nRestaurant looks cozy and inviting, but we found service not friendly, none of the waiters paid attention to us as tourists only 1 of the many waiters spoke English but definitely did not feel like it. There were some larger groups of noisy locals that were run for. The food was ok, but certainly not better than other local addresses where we ate for less than half the price. I also found a hair in my food. Overall disappointing experience not recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten May 23, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
